Subject: [PATCH] Keep the webkitglib/2.54 state these files had in the port

The port grew on the webkitglib/2.54 branch before it followed main, and in
these files the merges kept the release branch's text: its NEWS entries and
WPE options, three LayoutTests and an API test, and a few WebCore, WebKit and
B3 hunks that main changed differently. Nothing here is needed by the port;
it is kept so the series reproduces the port's tree exactly, and is the first
patch to drop on a rebase.
